<p>You have learned to find and hit weak spots. All your strikes have a <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2.3%, 4.4%, 5.8%, 6.7%, 7.5%</acronym> greater chance to be critical hits, and your critical hits do <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">7.5%, 13%, 16%, 18%, 20%</acronym> more damage.</p><p>Also, when using knives and throwing knives, you now use your Cunning instead of your Strength for bonus damage.</p>